The third quest
In the third quest, you must avoid the different explosives devices placed on the map and move ahead. To begin the quest go to crystal city and enter the abandoned factory. You'll find that different explosives are placed inside. If you step on them you'll die immediately. 
Meanwhile the various thugs can kill you too if you're not careful. Use your camera to locate the explosives, carefully making your way forward. After you move ahead you have to kill the unseelers agent to complete the quest. After you kill the agent you may move to finish the quest.